repository-code: "https://github.com/khayoubIsmail/llm-web-agents-survey-evidence"
abstract: >
  Machine-readable evidence register for the survey "LLM-Based Agents for
  Generalized Web Automation and Schema-Guided Data Extraction". Contains a
  reconciled 805-study systematic-mapping corpus and a 403-study
  published/accepted citation-eligibility pool, with full field-level metadata,
  priority tiers, publication-status verification, 403 normalized paper notes,
  403 one-paper-per-file synthesis source records, retained historical source-note
  snapshots, provenance/remediation audits, and strict exclusion records.
keywords:
  - LLM agents
  - web automation
  - data extraction
  - systematic mapping
  - evidence register
  - survey
